WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.831
What it costs when options cannot see each other.

00:00:04.831 --> 00:00:07.944
259 committed blocks, pooled into a scaling curve.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:16.239
Permuted questions whose answer flips, pooled by base model.

00:00:16.239 --> 00:00:20.372
Qwen2.5-0.5B prototype, 15.3%; Qwen3.5-9B, 1.8%.

00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:27.811
One recipe, four backbone sizes: 15.3, 6.0, 3.8, 1.8.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:35.667
−5.8 pp accuracy that option isolation, invariant by construction, costs at 4B.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:43.392
Jev's mean probability movement under permutation, with zero flips in 324: 0.0202.

00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:48.337
No repeat-request control has been run on this suite.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:54.320
Order sensitivity is a dial, not a switch, and the dial is mostly capacity.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:01:01.608
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
